# Ignore Internship Report
docs/Internship_Report.docx

# Numbered figure copies for the research paper. Every one of these is a
# duplicate of a diagram already tracked or regenerable from the prompts brief;
# the four the README embeds are tracked under assets/readme/ instead.
assets/research-paper/

# Working notes for writing the report, kept local alongside the figures and the
# report itself: the brief the assets/ diagrams were generated from, and the
# project proposal that preceded the work.
docs/image_generation_prompts.md
docs/project_proposal.md

# Locally generated human-evaluation databases (incl. WAL sidecar files)
reports/human_golden_question_evaluation/*.db
reports/human_golden_question_evaluation/*.db-*
reports/chat_feedback/*.csv
reports/chat_feedback/*.jsonl
report_and_slide/*

# Hard links to the source PDFs, generated at startup so Streamlit can serve
# them (see publish_source_pdfs) -- rebuilt on every run, never committed
static/

# Screen-recording source for the README demo. 84 MB at 3326x2160 -- the
# committed assets/readme/demo.gif is generated from it, so the source itself has no
# reason to be in git history forever.
*.mp4

# Local chat history written by the assistant's conversation rail (incl. the
# WAL sidecar files) -- per-machine, never committed
chat_history.db
chat_history.db-*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Environment
.env
.venv/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
